  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies whether a wallet card is a payment card, a non-payment card, or has an unknown type.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>These values represent the Android <c>WalletCard.CARD_TYPE_*</c> constants. Constructors of <see cref="T:Android.Service.QuickAccessWallet.WalletCard.Builder" /> that omit the card type use <see cref="F:Android.Service.QuickAccessWallet.WalletCardType.Unknown" />.</para>
      <para>Based on the constants and constructors in the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/refs/tags/android-16.0.0_r1/core/java/android/service/quickaccesswallet/WalletCard.java">Android 16 implementation</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
